ass=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.97.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<p><b>Frozen Trees</b> can be obtained by using the <a href=\"/wiki/Icethrower\" title=\"Icethrower\">Icethrower</a> on any tree which is obtainable by opening the <a href=\"/wiki/Gift_of_Frozen_Flames\" title=\"Gift of Frozen Flames\">Gift of Frozen Flames</a>. It works similar to the process of using a <a href=\"/wiki/Flamethrower\" title=\"Flamethrower\">Flamethrower</a> to turn any tree into an <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Tree</a>. When using the Icethrower on a tree the tree emits blue fire particles around it until after a few seconds it turns into a Frozen Tree.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 684px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b5/Frozen_Tree.png/revision/latest?cb=20251227023710\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Frozen Tree\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"684\" height=\"385\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Frozen Tree